   "title": "Lighthouse trip",
   "noteType": "page",
   "content": {
    "version": 1,
    "markdown": "# Lighthouse trip\n\nThree days on the coast in **late May**, when the ferry runs twice a day.\n\n## Pack\n\n- [x] Rain jacket\n- [ ] Binoculars\n- [ ] *Field guide* to sea birds\n\n## Route\n\n1. Train to the harbour\n2. Morning ferry\n3. Walk the cliff path to the light\n\n> The keeper lets visitors climb the stairs on Sundays.\n\nBudget: `£240` for the cottage.\n",
